## LATER (same day): M68 and M69 were killed by a row that never reaches the case that
## matters. A server stopped at once never has its accept thread waiting in accept();
## a server that has SERVED does, and on this Mac shutdown() does not wake that wait —
## so the fix these two mutations 'pinned' was itself wrong (red-2026-10-01-f).
